,"resolved_place_entity_id":6089,"start_index":71,"tongjian_id":"c50d3ba9-db0e-11ef-8818-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"峯州","place_name_jianti_auto":"峰州","resolved_place_entity_id":2609,"start_index":74,"tongjian_id":"c50d3baa-db0e-11ef-b5ab-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蠻","place_name_jianti_auto":"蛮","resolved_place_entity_id":157,"start_index":76,"tongjian_id":"c50d3bab-db0e-11ef-addd-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"交趾之战","tongjian_id":"war_N1050"},{"title":"唐与南诏战争","tongjian_id":"war_N1007"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/三、梧州府（卷一百八）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"又石晋天福二年，交州乱，南汉刘图乘机取其地，屯兵于海门...","context_before":"...，安南为南诏所陷，置行交州于海门镇，寻复置安南都护于此。","source_end_index":103,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"267a98b7-cc40-5c28-a38a-da9263b6c3ac","source_start_index":87,"source_text":"六年，高骈治兵海门镇，进复安南。"}],"path":"广西方舆纪要/三、梧州府（卷一百八）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二十五、安南（卷一百十二）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"]。","context_before":"...县，属宋州。明年，改属交州。大历五年废。贞元八年，复置。","source_end_index":263,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"4740ae15-ee50-59ae-ab96-42f5b9667f23","source_start_index":228,"source_text":"咸通六年，高骈为安南都护，自海门进兵至南定，掩击峰州蛮众，大破之，即此"},{"context_after":"今有天威泾，骈所凿也。《唐史》：咸通二年，南诏攻安南，都...","context_before":"...大长沙海口，其可入之支港以数十计。马援讨征侧，缘海而进。","source_end_index":67,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"cfb610a9-e4c2-5a59-b28c-eb1eabd25b5a","source_start_index":54,"source_text":"高骈复安南，亦自海道而前。"}],"path":"广西方舆纪要/二十五、安南（卷一百十二）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"11高駢治兵於海門，未進；監軍李維周惡駢，欲去之，屢趣駢使進軍。駢以五千人先濟，約維周發兵應援；駢旣行，維周擁餘衆，不發一卒以繼之。九月，駢至南定，峯州蠻衆近五萬；方穫田，駢掩擊，大破之，收其所穫以食軍。","content_fanyi":"高骈在海门镇训练军队，没有向安南进攻；监军李维周厌恶高骈，想把他排挤走，多次催促高骈向安南府进军。高骈率五千人先渡江，与李维周约定由他随后发兵接应支援；高骈出发以后，李维周把持着其余部众，没有派出一兵一卒前去接应。九月，高骈抵达南定县，峰州蛮军将近五万人；蛮军正在收割田中庄稼，高骈乘其不备突然袭击，大败蛮军，夺取他们收割的粮食用作军粮。","content_jianti_auto":"11高骈治兵于海门，未进；监军李维周恶骈，欲去之，屡趣骈使进军。骈以五千人先济，约维周发兵应援；骈既行，维周拥余众，不发一卒以继之。九月，骈至南定，峰州蛮众近五万；方获田，骈掩击，大破之，收其所获以食军。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"者，今安在哉？受制妖人，门无噍类，一旦而为天下嗤笑，繇是...","context_before":"...以明志，偃蹇无聊，化为妖幻，闭于闺中，邑邑以死，回视昔之","source_end_index":104,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"b60ab7bc-2231-4b4c-8b3b-6501d1ee7ade","source_start_index":95,"source_text":"悬军渡海、深入蛮中"}],"title":"四 小才难当大任"}],"id":25620,"number":11,"reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"c50ad53f-db0e-11ef-ac72-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"考異曰：舊傳，大中末崩，誤也。今從實錄。","note_content_jianti_auto":"考异曰：旧传，大中末崩，误也。今从实录。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"c50d3bae-db0e-11ef-8dd7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"鄭氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"郑氏","people_xingming":"郑氏","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"c50d3bb2-db0e-11ef-87bb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"12冬，十二月，壬子，太皇太后鄭氏崩。","content_fanyi":"冬季，十二月初五日壬子，太皇太后郑氏去世。","content_jianti_auto":"12冬，十二月，壬子，太皇太后郑氏崩。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":25621,"number":12,"reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"c50d3bad-db0e-11ef-a693-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"六年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"六年","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"c50ad4f8-db0e-11ef-a9b2-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（乙酉、八六五）","year_int":865},"message":"success","success":true}